        <tr><td>Duty cycle</td><td>Standby: idle for weeks or months, then a single full cold-crank on demand &mdash; no daily alternator recharge.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Starting demand</td><td>850&ndash;1100+ CCA on demand; 24V starting on larger sets.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Environment</td><td>Idle self-discharge of 3&ndash;5% per month; sulfation risk while below full charge.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Battery requirements</td><td>Heavy-duty flooded or AGM plus a float charger/maintainer that holds full charge.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Recommended characteristics</td><td>High CCA plus float-charge discipline and annual load testing; 3&ndash;5 year life is typical with maintenance &mdash; confirm voltage against the set.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

